{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The print-attributes group is used by the print element. The new-system and new-page attributes indicate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether to force a system or page break, or to force the current music onto the same system or page as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"preceding music. Normally this is the first music data within a measure. If used in multi-part music, they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should be placed in the same positions within each part, or the results are undefined. The page-number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute sets the number of a new page; it is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. Version 2.0 adds a blank-page","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute. This is a positive integer value that specifies the number of blank pages to insert before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current measure. It is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. These blank pages have no music, but may have text or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"images specified by the credit element. This is used to allow a combination of pages that are all text, or all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"text and images, together with pages of music.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlprint\/attributes-swift.struct"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrint"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorM